  "main_findings": [
    "The classical reservoir proxy does not beat the primary traditional baseline (linear_har) on panel QLIKE.",
    "Reservoir seed-median mean QLIKE diff vs linear_har = 0.0323063, asset wins = 2/8, bootstrap CI = [-0.000588394, 0.0705573].",
